{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56036","headline":"叠秀山 · 周渭","name":"叠秀山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生赋性爱观澜，今日登临叠秀山。\n天锡卦爻分象外，地将圭笏出人间。\n昭州本遶孤城小，五岭山高衆垤难。\n极且紫宸何处是，碧云深处佩珊珊。\n（见《粤西诗载》卷十三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周渭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}